  "fullDescription": "Boho flowers, leaves, grass set watercolor hand drawing. Boho illustrations cliparts (PNG files with transparent background) hand drawn. Pampas grass, palm leaves, orchid, wild flowers, tropical leaves in a vase, glass jar, ets.\n\nBright hand painted watercolor flowers clipart for mood board design, wedding invitation, greeting card, thank you card, party invitation, planner sticker, design blog, website, logo, banner, poster, birthday project, flyer, brochure, cover, presentation, print template, scrapbooking artwork, baby shower and so on.\n\nThis set includes 84 items:\n– 23 individual elements in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 2500 px x 3500 px / 8,3 in x 11,7 in);\n– 11 compositions and 3 wreaths in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes about 5000 px x 6000 px / 16,7 in x 20 in); -7 – – seamless (repeating) patterns in PNG files with transparent background and 7 seamless patterns in JPEG files with white and colored – – background (different sizes 6000 px x 6000 px / 20 in x 20 in and 5000 px x 5000 px / 16,7 in x 16,7 in);\n– 5 frames in PNG files with transparent background (different sizes 4000 px x 5000 px / 13,3 in x 16,7 in);\n– 8 backgrounds in JPG files (size 3600 px x 3600 px / 12 in x 12 in);\n– 20 geometric elements in PNG files with transparent background (size 3000 px x 2500 px / 10 in x 8,3 in).\n\nCompatible with all major programs (Photoshop, Word, Canva, GIMP, etc.).\nFeel free to send me a message or leave a comment if you have any questions or concerns.\nThank you for visiting my shop!",
